<title>SWITZERLAND: Clariant sees sales uptrend in Q2.</title>
<headline>Clariant sees sales uptrend in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>MUTTENZ, Switzerland 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss speciality chemicals group Clariant International AG said all business sectors contributed to dynamic first quarter sales growth and it expected this uptrend to continue in the second quarter.</p>
<p>Sales in sectors:</p>
<p> Textile dyes		   182		 vs 155</p>
<p> Textile chemicals	    104		 vs 82</p>
<p> Leather			  71		  vs 55</p>
<p> Paper			    97		  vs 75</p>
<p> Pigments/Additives	   78		  vs 65</p>
<p> Masterbatches		  132		 vs 91</p>
<p> Other			    25		  vs 25</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
